    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb two-bedroom ground-floor apartment enjoying a south facing terrace in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nOn entering this amazing property, we have an inviting entrance hall. To the left, there are two spacious double bedrooms, both enjoying superb natural light, laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes. To the right, we have a generous storage room and separate hot press.The property enjoys a fully tiled bathroom with well-kept sanitary ware. The property is completed by a bright and spacious open-plan living room, kitchen and dining area. The kitchen boasts tiled flooring, ample counter and cupboard space, along with splashback tiling.The living room is spacious and bright and also provides access to the amazing private south facing terrace , making this an ideal space to relax and entertain. This superb property is further complemented by lift access, a designated car space and access to the communal roof terrace.\r\n\r\nSunnybank is an attractive development with a brick façade, ideally located on Conyngham Road, next to the Phoenix Park. There are plenty of shops, cafés, bars and restaurants in nearby Kilmainham, Islandbridge, Chapelizod and Parkgate Street.The city centre is easily accessible via the Red LUAS line and Dublin Bus. Heuston Station and the new children’s hospital at St James’s are also within walking distance."
      },
